nction is differentiable at $x=0$\n- The function is differentiable at $x=-1$" 13194139534175 true] [17592186280538 1113 #uuid "6a458dca-2a43-5376-8057-5ac8e05b0c07" 13194139534175 true] [17592186280538 1145 "- Statement I is true. The graph can be drawn in a neighborhood of $x=1$ without taking the pencil off the paper.\n\n- Statement II is false. The function $f(x)$ has a cusp at this point and so it is not differentiable there.\n\n- Statement III is false. From the graph we can see that $f(x)$ has a corner point at $x=-1$ and so it is not differentiable there.\n\nTherefore, only statement I is true." 13194139534175 true] [17592186280539 1000 #edb/ref 17592186280540 13194139534175 true] [17592186280539 1000 #edb/ref 17592186280541 13194139534175 true] [17592186280539 1000 #edb/ref 17592186280542 13194139534175 true] [17592186280539 1000 #edb/ref 17592186280543 13194139534175 true] [17592186280539 1000 #edb/ref 17592186280544 13194139534175 true] [17592186280539 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534175 true] [17592186280539 1041 "selection" 13194139534175 true] [17592186280539 1104 #edb/ref 17592186280542 13194139534175 true] [17592186280539 1110 #uuid "d960b9f1-b25b-5805-ba6a-d074e64d57a6" 13194139534175 true] [17592186280540 1034 "II and III only" 13194139534175 true] [17592186280540 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534175 true] [17592186280540 1111 #uuid "623b76d9-dfec-5a8a-8036-e643c5992d52" 13194139534175 true] [17592186280541 1034 "I and III only" 13194139534175 true] [17592186280541 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534175 true] [17592186280541 1111 #uuid "b3dfdd94-afce-50db-b653-41884606efb3" 13194139534175 true] [17592186280542 1034 "I only" 13194139534175 true] [17592186280542 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534175 true] [17592186280542 1111 #uuid "e823b158-fdc8-5fb0-8a68-6bb926fff1a7" 13194139534175 true] [17592186280543 1034 "III only" 13194139534175 true] [17592186280543 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534175 true] [17592186280543 1